  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0.078,
      "end": 4.86,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "现在天气嘞越来越热，好多人热嘞就觉得啊那个心烦意乱，",
      "score": 0.3219,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.4356,
        "sc_logprob": -0.4265,
        "sc_delta": 0.0091,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.396,
        "seg_cer": 0.167,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "嘞",
        "text_free": "现在这天气呢，越来越热，好多人热呢，就觉得啊，那个心烦意乱啊。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 4.987,
      "end": 9.244,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "然后嘞白天昏昏沉沉的，到了晚上嘞哎那特别精神，",
      "score": 0.4637,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.6677,
        "sc_logprob": -0.6516,
        "sc_delta": 0.0161,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.689,
        "seg_cer": 0.143,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "嘞",
        "text_free": "然后呢，白天昏昏沉沉的，到了晚上呢，哎，那就特别精神。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 9.244,
      "end": 13.405,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "搞起来就睡眠质量就差了。那啷子来提高这个睡眠质量？",
      "score": 0.1791,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0186,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0187,
        "sc_delta": -0.0001,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.304,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "咧",
        "text_free": "关系咧，就水面质量就差了。那啷子来提高这个水面质量？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 13.405,
      "end": 16.798,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "或者讲在饮食方面我们该啷子合理的安排嘞？",
      "score": 0.2228,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.291,
        "sc_logprob": -0.2711,
        "sc_delta": 0.0199,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.213,
        "seg_cer": 0.158,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "嘞",
        "text_free": "或者讲，在饮食方面，我们应该啷子合理地安排呢？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 16.798,
      "end": 22.875,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "我们看着。首先我们要了解，除了一些药食两用的传统养生食材，",
      "score": 0.0176,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1228,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1354,
        "sc_delta": -0.0126,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.038,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "我们来看着。首先，我们要了解，除了一些药食两用的传统养生食材。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 23.074,
      "end": 25.908,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "比如山楂、银桂圆、莲子之类，",
      "score": 0.1616,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1789,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1648,
        "sc_delta": 0.0142,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.071,
        "seg_cer": 0.273,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "比如，宣纸印、桂圆、莲子之类。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 26.213,
      "end": 30.34,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "食物当中的营养成分对睡眠也可能有所影响。",
      "score": 0.0641,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0014,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0017,
        "sc_delta": -0.0003,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.053,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "嘞",
        "text_free": "食物当中嘞营养成分对睡眠也可能有所影响。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 30.431,
      "end": 34.494,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "一、摄入过高的脂肪不利于入睡，",
      "score": 0.1496,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.3503,
        "sc_logprob": -0.4859,
        "sc_delta": -0.1356,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.288,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "一摄入过高的脂肪不利于入睡。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 34.495,
      "end": 38.132,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "特别是夜晚最好少吃点油腻的东西。",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.001,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0011,
        "sc_delta": -0.0001,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "特别是夜晚，最好少吃点油腻的东西。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 38.414,
      "end": 42.98,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "第二，摄入较多的蛋白质，非阳人更加清醒，",
      "score": 0.3563,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.4152,
        "sc_logprob": -0.4313,
        "sc_delta": -0.0162,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.37,
